# Your HR Team Is Buried in Spreadsheets

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/manual-hr-processes/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

As headcount grows, spreadsheet-based HR processes stop scaling. Onboarding checklists get missed, leave balances go out of sync, and payroll inputs require manual reconciliation every cycle, all of which eats HR team time that should go toward people, not paperwork.